OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's flood scheme request
OL,4,Aapproach 'entirely unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council "failed at the most basic
OL,7,Flevel" in its response to freedom of
OL,8,Finformation (FOI) requests about a
OL,9,Fflood protection scheme, a watchdog has
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FDumfries and Galloway Council was asked
OL,13,Fabout common good land affected by the
OL,14,FWhitesands project and whether it had
OL,15,Fpetitioned the courts for a change of
OL,16,Fuse.
OL,18,FIt initially claimed the information
OL,19,Fwas exempt but, after an appeal to the
OL,20,FScottish Information Commissioner
OL,21,F(SIC), said it did not hold it at all.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
