OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's flood scheme request
OL,4,Aapproach 'entirely unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, when asked what searches had
OL,7,Fbeen carried out, it said there had
OL,8,Fbeen none as it had "no reason to
OL,9,Fbelieve the information should be
OL,10,Fheld". The council is now considering
OL,11,Fthe commissioner's findings.
